// Use the shared block +gateway without defining it in the diagram
architecture Route a request through a gateway

box client as Client [note: sends a request, icon: user]
+gateway gw as API gateway [note: checks and routes]
box orders as Orders service [note: handles orders, icon: server]

step Request
  say The client sends its request to the gateway, the only way in.
  client -> gw: request

step Route
  say The gateway checks the token and forwards the request to the orders service.
  gw -> orders: forward
